- llama.cpp, commit 6050b467c07a95c7b87debd4ddac2f8ba8d9b807, Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors, MIT licence. Tile, dequantisation and matrix-vector patterns in native/kernels/ (grouped_mm, grouped_mm_f32, grouped_mpp, dense_q8_staged_f32, moe_router_f32_batch, qsa_prefill, nax_prefill, gdn_chunk and raw_decode) and native/src/raw_decode_component.cpp. The licence text is in native/third_party/llama-cpp/LICENSE.
- ggml, Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors, MIT licence. native/src/gdn_chunk_math.cpp follows the CS64 graph algebra at llama.cpp 6050b467c07a95c7b87debd4ddac2f8ba8d9b807. The licence text is in its header and native/third_party/llama-cpp/LICENSE.
- mlx-vlm 0.7.1, commit 1ecf1ecdd28af102eded679be0daa5c76ab2a068, Copyright (c) 2025 Prince Canuma, MIT licence. The sparse attention kernel in native/kernels/qsa_sparse_attention.metal. The licence text is in its header and native/third_party/mlx-vlm/LICENSE.
- Splash 1.4.0, commit 1482f6bbc2abf12375332725302019594150b6cb, Apache License 2.0. Convolution, ring attention and candidate selection in native/kernels/dflash2.metal, the register top-k helpers in native/kernels/logit_topk.metal, the three-part BF16 weight split, plane matmul and split reduction in native/kernels/nax_prefill.metal, and DFlash2VerifyBudget in native/src/dflash2_drafter.cpp and native/include/tokspur/dflash2_drafter.hpp. The licence and upstream third-party notices are in native/third_party/splash/.
