native/third_party/sources.json records source paths, revisions and hashes. Signed release archives include the source manifest and bundled licences.

The Rust standard library is compiled into the Rust host binaries. The library-specific copyright and dependency licences from the pinned Rust 1.99.1 distribution are retained in third_party/rust/COPYRIGHT-library.html and distributed with staged packages and release archives. The document covers library sources and dependencies across supported platforms, including components beyond this Mac binary. It is retained as supplied. The Rust compiler is not redistributed.

